Z||000003||loafer87gt||02-19-2001||09:36 PM||||I hate Win95, 98, and ME. I've always used NT 4.0 and Windows 2000 on my rendering box and have never had any problems with any of these operating systems, they'are rock solid. The one app that I'm really looking forward too is Windows XP. They are finally getting rid of the old Windows kernal and using the Windows 2000 kernal. Microsofts goal is to get rid of the whole Windows 2000 / Win 95,98,ME divide and have just one operating system. I think this will also be great for hardware developers as it means they only have to write one set of drivers. You can check out some screens and stuff over at <A HREF="http://www.microsoft.com" TARGET=_blank>www.microsoft.com</A>  ||||reg||1
